# Names the guide shows in bold that tools/lint-guide.py does not find in
# faraday/faraday-strings/src/en.rs: test values, glyphs, words of the public
# test keys, and text the app makes outside en.rs. One name per line, then
# "  # reason". A line "re:<pattern>" matches a whole name.
-  # the stepper's minus
+  # the stepper's plus
12  # a word count, a button and a value
24  # a word count, a button and a value
BIP-137  # a signature format button of Sign a message
BIP-322  # a signature format button of Sign a message
